(7324685, 1142986, 177322, '<td valign="top">Who would have thought that a tractor could be a suitable Orton Effect subject?  The application of the technique looks good although since you were so bold in your subject selection, I think you could have been more bold in applying the technique.  Nonetheless, it impressed me enough to rate it as an eight. Most unique.  Good luck with it.</td>', 'Who would have thought that a tractor could be a suitable Orton Effect subject?  The application of the technique looks good although since you were so bold in your subject selection, I think you could have been more bold in applying the technique.  Nonetheless, it impressed me enough to rate it as an eight. Most unique.  Good luck with it.', '2015-03-07 09:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7324691, 1143422, 177322, '<td valign="top">Personally, I thought this challenge would be purrfect for moggies, but the submissions seem sparse.  The DoF on the eyes is so sharp (a good thing normally!) perhaps the technique did not apply consistently across the image.  Still I like the "glowing" whiskers.  Six from me.<br/> <br/>I''ll wager this beauty rules your household, yes?</td>', 'Personally, I thought this challenge would be purrfect for moggies, but the submissions seem sparse.  The DoF on the eyes is so sharp (a good thing normally!) perhaps the technique did not apply consistently across the image.  Still I like the "glowing" whiskers.  Six from me. I''ll wager this beauty rules your household, yes?', '2015-03-07 09:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7324695, 1143623, 177322, '<td valign="top">Most impressive.  The radiance resulting from the technique is stunning. Bumped two numbers upon reviewing a second time.  Eight from me.</td>', 'Most impressive.  The radiance resulting from the technique is stunning. Bumped two numbers upon reviewing a second time.  Eight from me.', '2015-03-07 09:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7324700, 1143006, 177322, '<td valign="top">The cute kitty is just too dark; the background too harsh.  So sorry, but a four from me. Do not be discouraged, I think this kitty would be a purrfect subject to continue to shoot and practice applying the Orton Effect.  I''ll bet in the right light you could get some beautiful golden radiance around him. S/he seems like a willing subject - have some fun with him.</td>', 'The cute kitty is just too dark; the background too harsh.  So sorry, but a four from me. Do not be discouraged, I think this kitty would be a purrfect subject to continue to shoot and practice applying the Orton Effect.  I''ll bet in the right light you could get some beautiful golden radiance around him. S/he seems like a willing subject - have some fun with him.', '2015-03-07 09:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7324762, 1143615, 35804, '<td valign="top">I have to fave this now...I feel like it''s inside my head and I like the sensation of that.</td>', 'I have to fave this now...I feel like it''s inside my head and I like the sensation of that.', '2015-03-07 11:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7324822, 1143665, 177322, '<td valign="top">Purrfect!  I expected a few moggies to be subjects of this challenge, just not kitties of this size.  Really sweet moment enhanced beautifully with the technique.  Bumped three numbers upon a second review: nine.  Wishing you luck.</td>', 'Purrfect!  I expected a few moggies to be subjects of this challenge, just not kitties of this size.  Really sweet moment enhanced beautifully with the technique.  Bumped three numbers upon a second review: nine.  Wishing you luck.', '2015-03-07 12:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325237, 1143597, 177322, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! She glows yet her details and color are not lost. The luminescence of the snowfall is so dreamy. Ten from me.</td>', 'Gorgeous! She glows yet her details and color are not lost. The luminescence of the snowfall is so dreamy. Ten from me.', '2015-03-08 10:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325251, 1143648, 177322, '<td valign="top">Most captivating PoV. Good composition. Ethereal. Eight.</td>', 'Most captivating PoV. Good composition. Ethereal. Eight.', '2015-03-08 11:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325272, 1143227, 177322, '<td valign="top">Interesting find. Perhaps a bit too centered for the crop.  I think Advanced Rules would allow for you to clone out the black specs.  Not sure that I see much of an Orton Effect applied - especially on the pine cone itself, still I like the marked textural change from the prickly pine cone to the cottony snow. Five.</td>', 'Interesting find. Perhaps a bit too centered for the crop.  I think Advanced Rules would allow for you to clone out the black specs.  Not sure that I see much of an Orton Effect applied - especially on the pine cone itself, still I like the marked textural change from the prickly pine cone to the cottony snow. Five.', '2015-03-08 12:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325273, 1143636, 177322, '<td valign="top">While I, personally, am having difficulty with the perspective - can''t orient myself - I very much enjoy its abstract quality. Six.</td>', 'While I, personally, am having difficulty with the perspective - can''t orient myself - I very much enjoy its abstract quality. Six.', '2015-03-08 12:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325646, 1143658, 150277, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The colors seem to pop nicely and I like the texture apparent in the tree trunks.  I definitely see some high and some low detail areas.</td>', 'I like this.  The colors seem to pop nicely and I like the texture apparent in the tree trunks.  I definitely see some high and some low detail areas.', '2015-03-09 14:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7325648, 1143655, 150277, '<td valign="top">I like this image.  While I see some fine branches, I am not sure how many areas of fine details I am seeing, so I feel unsure of how well this meets the challenge.</td>', 'I like this image.  While I see some fine branches, I am not sure how many areas of fine details I am seeing, so I feel unsure of how well this meets the challenge.', '2015-03-09 14:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
