(7325881, 1143379, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is really pretty...but the title makes me think of Alabama and a really good documentary movie with the same title...and I don''t think this is Alabama...unless they grew some mountains recently. The colors are really lovely.</td>', 'This is really pretty...but the title makes me think of Alabama and a really good documentary movie with the same title...and I don''t think this is Alabama...unless they grew some mountains recently. The colors are really lovely.', '2015-03-10 15:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
