(7325953, 1143648, 150277, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully unique entry.  The plane sure pops, and I love the simplicity of the scene and the muted colors.  Yet I still think this was a perfect example of the Orton Effect.  Had that plane been just a bit high, just above the mountains, this would have been my favorite.  (It''s still my number 2).</td>', 'Wonderfully unique entry.  The plane sure pops, and I love the simplicity of the scene and the muted colors.  Yet I still think this was a perfect example of the Orton Effect.  Had that plane been just a bit high, just above the mountains, this would have been my favorite.  (It''s still my number 2).', '2015-03-10 23:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326026, 1143539, 97225, '<td valign="top">Love this! Blue ribbon from me.</td>', 'Love this! Blue ribbon from me.', '2015-03-11 07:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
