(7326524, 1143439, 94815, '<td valign="top">I try and try and try but haven''t found the processing to produce this result. Good framing, terrific detail, perfect tonal range for the winter wonderland effect.</td>', 'I try and try and try but haven''t found the processing to produce this result. Good framing, terrific detail, perfect tonal range for the winter wonderland effect.', '2015-03-12 22:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326526, 1143252, 94815, '<td valign="top">Dramatic pose; fantastic environment: Orton''s objectives I presume. Whatever, it grabs my attention.</td>', 'Dramatic pose; fantastic environment: Orton''s objectives I presume. Whatever, it grabs my attention.', '2015-03-12 23:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326528, 1143430, 94815, '<td valign="top">I dunno about Orton but this shot is near perfection from any number of ways of viewing.</td>', 'I dunno about Orton but this shot is near perfection from any number of ways of viewing.', '2015-03-12 23:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326529, 1143476, 94815, '<td valign="top">Beautiful graphic detail and composition. Orton? I can''t opine. Still an enviable shot.</td>', 'Beautiful graphic detail and composition. Orton? I can''t opine. Still an enviable shot.', '2015-03-12 23:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326530, 1143081, 94815, '<td valign="top">Crop off the left to the second pole and you have a very powerful shot. As is, diluted by the excess on the left. I wanted to give a 7 but couldn''t for the aforesaid reason.</td>', 'Crop off the left to the second pole and you have a very powerful shot. As is, diluted by the excess on the left. I wanted to give a 7 but couldn''t for the aforesaid reason.', '2015-03-12 23:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326531, 1143543, 177838, '<td valign="top">This turned out nice. Well done.</td>', 'This turned out nice. Well done.', '2015-03-12 23:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326532, 1143624, 94815, '<td valign="top">Capturing and making such a common little sparrow into a sympathetic, even monumental creature is an incredible feat. Impressive photographic result.</td>', 'Capturing and making such a common little sparrow into a sympathetic, even monumental creature is an incredible feat. Impressive photographic result.', '2015-03-12 23:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326533, 1143649, 177838, '<td valign="top">My top pick</td>', 'My top pick', '2015-03-12 23:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326534, 1143623, 94815, '<td valign="top">Aside from the oversaturation, it''s an impressive result of whatever Ortonesque processing applied.</td>', 'Aside from the oversaturation, it''s an impressive result of whatever Ortonesque processing applied.', '2015-03-12 23:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326535, 1143545, 94815, '<td valign="top">Lovely Ortonesque impact.</td>', 'Lovely Ortonesque impact.', '2015-03-12 23:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326536, 1143639, 177838, '<td valign="top">Great colours in this one</td>', 'Great colours in this one', '2015-03-12 23:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326537, 1143637, 94815, '<td valign="top">Love the tattoo and underexploited canvass of skin. I feel some very sensitively applied edginess as a twist to the more conventional pinup pic.</td>', 'Love the tattoo and underexploited canvass of skin. I feel some very sensitively applied edginess as a twist to the more conventional pinup pic.', '2015-03-12 23:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326538, 1143560, 177838, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m falling to the right.I like the aqueduct boat combination.</td>', 'I feel like I''m falling to the right.I like the aqueduct boat combination.', '2015-03-12 23:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326539, 1143638, 94815, '<td valign="top">The bird competes in a losing battle with the brightly lighted cacti. The bird is good and would be much better without the right half of the frame.</td>', 'The bird competes in a losing battle with the brightly lighted cacti. The bird is good and would be much better without the right half of the frame.', '2015-03-12 23:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326540, 1143397, 94815, '<td valign="top">The Ortonesque effect here works effectively as a glaze to smoothly blend the background and foreground elements of the composition. Said another way: the melding of the man and his city.</td>', 'The Ortonesque effect here works effectively as a glaze to smoothly blend the background and foreground elements of the composition. Said another way: the melding of the man and his city.', '2015-03-12 23:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326541, 1143650, 94815, '<td valign="top">Charming glow of the gleaming child enhanced Ortonly.</td>', 'Charming glow of the gleaming child enhanced Ortonly.', '2015-03-12 23:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326542, 1143444, 94815, '<td valign="top">Foggy forcefield finds fundamental foundation illuminating elemental ingredients naturally.</td>', 'Foggy forcefield finds fundamental foundation illuminating elemental ingredients naturally.', '2015-03-12 23:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326543, 1143668, 94815, '<td valign="top">The reduced size of this image somehow adds some charm as a primitively captured elemental environment but I still think it could look better larger. Palette and framing still make some magic.</td>', 'The reduced size of this image somehow adds some charm as a primitively captured elemental environment but I still think it could look better larger. Palette and framing still make some magic.', '2015-03-12 23:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326544, 1143551, 94815, '<td valign="top">These tourists are the closest I''ve seen to making them into monumental representations of what we find in our traveling excursions discovering special societies.</td>', 'These tourists are the closest I''ve seen to making them into monumental representations of what we find in our traveling excursions discovering special societies.', '2015-03-12 23:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326545, 1143597, 94815, '<td valign="top">Strong lady keeping our outdoors lively on wintery days.</td>', 'Strong lady keeping our outdoors lively on wintery days.', '2015-03-12 23:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326546, 1143654, 94815, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. The Orton effects work very nicely here.</td>', 'Lovely image. The Orton effects work very nicely here.', '2015-03-12 23:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326547, 1143593, 94815, '<td valign="top">Strong shadows and silhouettes work for me for the raw, portentous impact.</td>', 'Strong shadows and silhouettes work for me for the raw, portentous impact.', '2015-03-12 23:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326548, 1143572, 94815, '<td valign="top">Funny find. Lovingly framed.</td>', 'Funny find. Lovingly framed.', '2015-03-12 23:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326550, 1143560, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely evocative picture. Interesting colors and textures all around to enjoy, but the eye keeps coming back to the glowing boat. My top scoring image.</td>', 'Lovely evocative picture. Interesting colors and textures all around to enjoy, but the eye keeps coming back to the glowing boat. My top scoring image.', '2015-03-12 23:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326551, 1143605, 104230, '<td valign="top">Nice balance of glow and detail.  Well done. Interesting looking building as well.</td>', 'Nice balance of glow and detail.  Well done. Interesting looking building as well.', '2015-03-12 23:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7326552, 1143623, 104230, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 7, but for my taste there is rather too much "glow".<br/> <br/>ETA:  I wrote the above knowing that the objective of using the Orton effect is to product glow!  Perhaps some things are improved by adding a lot of glow and other things not so much and clearly this personal taste.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-03-16 21:54:47.</i></td>', 'I gave it a 7, but for my taste there is rather too much "glow". ETA:  I wrote the above knowing that the objective of using the Orton effect is to product glow!  Perhaps some things are improved by adding a lot of glow and other things not so much and clearly this personal taste.', '2015-03-12 23:52:57.000000', '2015-03-16 21:54:47.000000', 1),
