(7327192, 1143652, 93565, '<td valign="top">An exceptional use of the effect. Thank you a billion times, first and foremost, for not creating a Thomas Kinkade painting. That alone deserves a ribbon, methinks. But seriously, it''s a very pleasing application, it''s not overdone, it fits the mood, and I love the eeriness. The Orton Effect was strongly executed, but it fit nicely and is anything but garish. Well done.</td>', 'An exceptional use of the effect. Thank you a billion times, first and foremost, for not creating a Thomas Kinkade painting. That alone deserves a ribbon, methinks. But seriously, it''s a very pleasing application, it''s not overdone, it fits the mood, and I love the eeriness. The Orton Effect was strongly executed, but it fit nicely and is anything but garish. Well done.', '2015-03-15 02:04:06.000000', NULL, 0),
